2039   DC6D             ;* Solenoid Queue Processing: This is the routine that is called
2040   DC6D             ;* to fire a specific solenoid. It will add the solenoid to the 
2041   DC6D             ;* queue. Works from top down. Solenoid Number is in A along with
2042   DC6D             ;* data on how to handle solenoid. Format of A is ...
2043   DC6D             ;*
2044   DC6D             ;*      XXXZZZZZ    Where: ZZZZZ is solenoid number 00-10d
2045   DC6D             ;*                       XXX is timer/command
2046   DC6D             ;*
2047   DC6D             ;* NOTE: Hyperball only allows 8 solenoids + Shooter + BallLift
