4541   E9C8             ;***********************************************
4542   E9C8             ;* This routine is spawned as a thread when the
4543   E9C8             ;* credits in memory space do not match
4544   E9C8             ;* the number of credits in the CMOS RAM. It 
4545   E9C8             ;* Takes care of bringing them equal in a timely
4546   E9C8             ;* fashion and calling the game ROM hook each
4547   E9C8             ;* time a credit is added to the memory location. 
